 result←object(State Brush)arg;style;color
 result←⍬
 ⍝ 'Brush' style [fgcolor]
 ⍝ 'Brush' ¯1 hbrush
 ⍝ 'Brush' ¯2 bitmap

 '∆WI LENGTH ERROR: Brush'##.Error~1 2∊⍨≢arg
 style←⊃arg
 'DOMAIN ERROR'##.Error(~##.IsInt style)∨0≠≡style
 '∆WI DRAW ERROR: Invalid brush style'##.Error~style∊¯2 ¯1 0,⍳7
 :Select style
 :Case ¯2
     '∆WI LENGTH ERROR: Brush'##.Error 2≠≢arg
     :If ##.IsChar arg←2⊃arg
         '∆WI RANK ERROR: Brush'##.Error 1≠≢⍴1/arg
         State._brush←¯2,arg ⍝ No content checking at this time
     :ElseIf ##.IsNum arg
         State._brush←¯2,arg ⍝ No error checking at this time
     :Else
         ##.Error'∆WI DOMAIN ERROR: Brush'
     :EndIf
 :Case ¯1
     '∆WI LENGTH ERROR: Brush'##.Error 2≠≢arg
     'DOMAIN ERROR'##.Error~##.IsInt 2⊃arg
     State._brush←arg
 :Case 0
     State._brush←,style ⍝ Color completely ignored for transparent brushes; store only 1⍴0
 :Else
     arg,←arg≢⍛↓1(1⊃State._color_) ⍝ Append default (background color)
     color←2⊃arg ⍝ Color already assigned, checked and possibly modified
     :If 0=≢color ⋄ color←1⊃State._color_ ⋄ :EndIf
     'DOMAIN ERROR'##.Error~##.IsInt color
     '∆WI LENGTH ERROR: Brush'##.Error~color≢⍛∊1 3
     '∆WI DOMAIN ERROR: Brush'##.Error(3=≢color)∧∨/(color<0)∨color≥256
     '∆WI DOMAIN ERROR: Brush'##.Error(1=≢color)∨∨/color≥256*3
     '∆WI DOMAIN ERROR: Brush'##.Error(1=≢color)∨∨/(color<0)∧color≥¯100
     State._brush←style color ⍝ Remember this setting
 :EndSelect
